{c: Verse 1}
[Em]behti nadi ka hai [Am]rukh kal yahan ,
[C]kal kahan,[D]kya pata kya khata,
[Em]kyun chal diya [Am]karke yun bekarar ,
[C]ye dil ab [D]mera naa rahaaaa
[C]kisssi bhi bahane [D]tum tak aate the
[C]tumhe ye batane ki kitna [D]chahte the aise baat thi
[C]samajhe nahi jo [D]hum samjhate the,
[C]keh jaate the aankh [D]churate the aissi baat thi
[Em]raat bhar soye nahi,
[Am]hai sawaal ye,
[C]jaage reh gaye hum to,
[D]tere khayal mein,
[G]humsa [C]deewana tumne [D]dekha [A]hai kahin,
[G]gumsum [C]rehte teri [D]saari [A]baatein sahin,
[Em]dil mein basi hai bas teri tasveer,
[Am]mujhe kya oata kya hai meri tasveer,
[C]ki mein rahoon [D]paas tere roobaroo,
[C]raahoon mein kabhi [D]tum humko mil jaate
[C]hoth kabhi bhi shayad [D]sil jaate aise baat thi
[Em]jab se [Am]tere hum havaale [C]huae raasta [D]najar aane laga,
[C]thodi jo vafaa [D]hum tumse karte hein,
[C]pyare aisa lagta [D]hai hum darte hein,
[Em]dil ne nahi [Am]jo kaha tha [C]kabhi vakth karne [D]laga ab jara
[Em]pyar ka tarana hai [Am]ye suno to jaraa
[Em]tej raftaar hai [Am]kya thehro to jaraa
[G]aisa naseeba [C]hum dil [D]waaloon ka [A]hai ye
